          "url": "https://x.com/steipete/status/2109724776168300631",
          "topic": "Beyond vibe coding",
          "text": "said that last year, saying it again.\nvibes coding is a slur.",
          "quote_tweet": {
            "url": "https://x.com/signulll/status/2109317410301911551",
            "published_at": "2026-10-11T19:17:00Z",
            "author": {
              "name": "signüll",
              "handle": "signulll"
            },
            "text": "it’s clear we need to retire the term vibe coding because the models now produce better architecture & way more coherent code than an average software engineer.\n\nperhaps even better than top software engineers too because unlike a human, ai has a much much larger context window.\n\nthis ain’t vibe coding at all. it’s precision engineering.",
